{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211060","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121106001:0":{"text":"어디서 온 누구지? 누굴 찾고 있고?","source_cn":"你是谁？从哪里来的？要找谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76670C82AF3C0142","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121106002:0":{"text":"저도 잘 몰라요. 죄송합니다. 하지만 제가 찾고 있는 사람이 분명히 여기를 왔다 갔을 거예요. 이 근처에서 특별한 기운이 느껴지거든요...","source_cn":"十分抱歉，这些问题我也不知道。不过我能在附近感受到特殊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x625D51408602B5CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121106003:0":{"text":"아니 그래서... 근처가 좀 더워진 것 같지 않나요...? 설마 또 불이 난 건 아니겠지...","source_cn":"我说，附近是不是变热了……？不会又发生火灾吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A06EBEA171CC340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121106004:0":{"text":"이 사람도 무슨 일인지 잘 모르는 것 같은데, 도와줄 기사단원을 찾아볼까?","source_cn":"看起来她也说不清楚情况，要不要找骑士团的人帮忙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0735A8D79361C8EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1121106004":{"text":"이 사람도 무슨 일인지 잘 모르는 것 같은데, 도와줄 기사단원을 찾아볼까?","source_cn":"看起来她也说不清楚情况，要不要找骑士团的人帮忙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0735A8D79361C8EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var